      "content": "Thanks for the summary, that's a good start but it feels a little thin for a board report. I'm worried if I present it like this, the directors will think we didn't actually do much work during the audit. \n\nCan you expand on this? I really need more granularity. Break down the specific risks for each of those points so it looks more comprehensive. I'm still using that bullet point count to gauge the level of detail—if it's too low, I'm going to assume you've missed the nuances of the findings. Try to get a lot more depth in there.",
